      "message": "I don\u0027t share your distaste of this method and I don\u0027t think this is a good reason to deprecate it. If you want to deprecate it, we should probably cite a stance where we want all int representations of IPv4 addresses in higher- to lower-order bytes order. Do we actually have such a stance ?",
